@startuml
actor Human
participant CLI
participant Sessions
participant OS
database SQLite
participant Worktree
Human -> CLI : reconcile after interruption
CLI -> Sessions : load active execution attempts
Sessions -> SQLite : owner PID and creation identity
Sessions -> OS : verify matching live identities
alt live or unknown identity
Sessions --> Human : retain active state and block replay
else no matching owner or child
Sessions -> SQLite : INTERRUPTED and task failed
Sessions -> Worktree : preserve partial files in place
Human -> CLI : explicit recovery instructions
CLI -> SQLite : new bounded request and pending grant
CLI --> Human : new approval required
end
@enduml
